    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*** 3-BED END-TERRACE HOME ON THE EVER POPULAR STANNAWAY ROAD***\r\n\r\nADRIAN MURPHY OF MURPHY MULLAN ESTATE AGENTS RATHGAR is delighted to present to you this three-bedroom end-terraced home on Stannaway Road sure to catch your eye. The location of this property is unrivalled, offering its potential purchaser a rare chance to acquire a 3-bed property in close reach of the City Centre, Harold's Cross, Sundrive Village, The Grand Canal, Rathgar and Rathmines. There is also an array of local amenities close by in Sundrive and Kimmage.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of an entrance lobby, a living/dining room and a kitchen/breakfast room. Upstairs, there are three reasonable bedrooms and a family bathroom. Outside are neat front and rear gardens with a drive-in to the front for off-street parking and a long rear garden with a westerly aspect that can catch the sun and is perfect for relaxing. There is also the added benefit of a room to extend, subject to planning permission and still retain a large amount of garden space. \r\n\r\nThe location of this property is fantastic with all conceivable amenities within close proximity such as Crumlin Village, Our Lady's Children's Hospital, with schools, shops and shopping centres such as Sundrive Shopping Centre & Pickles Cafe within walking distance. Serviced by excellent public transport routes, No. 139 Clogher Road is the ideal choice for the discerning buyer who requires easy access to the city centre and beyond. There are numerous bus routes close by such as the S2, 27, 56A, 74, 83, 150 & 151. The M50 and N7 motorways are both within a few minutes drive by car making for easy access to the greater Dublin area. Eamonn Ceannt Park is close by which offers many leisure facilities which boasts running clubs and a large cycle track. \r\n\r\nThis property is a real gem and awaits its lucky new owners.\r\n\r\nPlease note that all measurements are approximate and photographs are provided for guidance only.\r\nWe have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "GFCH\r\nLocated on Quiet Mature Road\r\n3 Bedrooms\r\nLarge Rear Garden\r\nPotential to Extend\r\nDrive-in to Front\r\nExcellent Schools on its Doorstep\r\nClose proximity to the City Centre, Grand Canal, Harold's Cross & Terenure\r\nClose to an Abundance of Bus Routes\r\nClose to an Abundance of Necessary Amenities such as Sundrive Shopping Centre, Ashleaf Shopping Centre & Carlisle Gym\r\nIdeal First-Time Purchase"
      }
